  (limitations "one finite case: 53 witnesses - each of the committed 33 CSRs once, four alias pairs, FS Dirty with SD, and the refused writes and accesses in M, S and U")
  (limitations "the receipt's own limitation: not all REQ-D-CSR-SET or CPU acceptance")
  (limitations "mip's value is compared only through sip: this case's reference configuration carries a CLINT the laboratory does not declare, and it holds mip.MTIP; mip itself is witnessed by presence")
  (limitations "no claim about a CLINT or any device: it is the reference's source of time for this case, named by the case's overlay, and the laboratory declares none")
  (limitations "the negative side is the refused write and the privilege-refused access; a non-member CSR address trapping is not witnessed, because the spec-side deriver's vocabulary is the 33")
  (limitations "membership, not semantics: per-CSR field semantics stay with P4-SYSTEM.2, the counters' rates with REQ-D-ZICNTR, timer delivery with REQ-D-SSTC, and numerics with the F and D cases"))
