  (limitations "one finite case: 44 witnesses - the three base counters and the two machine views in M, their progress, five refused write attempts, a trap that retires nothing, the read gates in S and U, and two alias pairs")
  (limitations "the receipt's own limitation: not all REQ-D-ZICNTR or CPU acceptance")
  (limitations "a write through mcycle or minstret is not witnessed: the spec-side deriver refuses it, and the laboratory's time is a view of mcycle where the reference's comes from its CLINT, so a write would separate them")
  (limitations "Zihpm's absence is not witnessed, because the spec-side deriver's vocabulary is the 33; that it is not selected stays a statement of the selection")
  (limitations "rate and progress semantics stay the environment contract's (P4-SYSTEM.5, P4-SYSTEM.9): the values agree at these boundaries on this configuration, one tick per instruction, which claims no rate")
  (limitations "no claim about a CLINT or any device: it is the reference's source of time for this case, named by the case's overlay, and the laboratory declares none; timer delivery stays with REQ-D-SSTC"))
